{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他此刻最在意的，是那份靠近在变得稀薄、像暂时只剩一条细线之后，还能不能自己接续下去。m.35–37的轻薄和空缺因此不只是安静，而会让他守着那点尚未断掉的联系；m.38重新形成连续流动时，他能感到“还接得上”，但m.39的停驻与渐弱又使这件事保持未定——接上一次，并没有替他回答它能否继续。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H3：此前连续性曾经变得不稳，所以熟悉的靠近感再次出现时，他也不会仅凭它的重现认定连续已经恢复。\",\"bridge\":\"正因为一次重新出现已经不足以让他放心，他现在会特别留意靠近能否穿过稀薄、停顿或暂时缺少支撑的时刻，而不是只判断眼下有没有熟悉感。\",\"current\":\"因此这段先变薄、再重新连动、最后停驻渐弱的体验，会落在一个很具体的问题上：这份靠近是不是即使短暂变得稀疏，也仍有能力接回去。重新连动带来的是当下仍可延续的感觉，不是已经恢复稳定的结论。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H3，这里的稀薄与重新连动完全可以只是一次较轻的过渡或短暂收束，不必特别牵动“中间有空缺之后还能否继续”这个问题。\"},\"used\":[\"H3\"],\"new_history\":[\"H4：在连续性曾经变得不稳之后，他会把“经历一段稀薄或空缺后还能重新接上”与“已经恢复稳定连续”分开看；前者能让他暂时感到联系仍在，却不能替代对后续持续性的关注。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"解释依赖H3所建立的‘重现不等于恢复’；当前段只把这一点具体化到‘空缺后重新接上’的体验，没有把织体变化当成对方实际退开或回应，也没有新增决定、领悟或关系结果。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "091be61c-990e-4a4f-a182-612b48edd18a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215218588808Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.296, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:52:39.888174+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e33bf566d92425588323dfff57f57cfb6d1a5fc86f123c5372bb8e5a940cd0e4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T215218588808Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a45228373d2fbf5fbd0ee6f11518ae74fc9ceb83eebde8f1eb4593c8e51fc05a"}}}
